1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,577
Human exploration beyond Earth
brings extraordinary challenges.

2
00:00:04,597 --> 00:00:10,732
During long-duration space missions, understanding
changes in astronaut health becomes essential.

3
00:00:11,652 --> 00:00:16,322
Spaceflight can affect cardiovascular
function, bone and muscle health,

4
00:00:16,342 --> 00:00:20,285
sleep, behavior, and the body's
response to its environment.

5
00:00:20,305 --> 00:00:24,183
Astronauts need clear information
to monitor these changes.

6
00:00:25,103 --> 00:00:30,153
ASTRA VITAL is an offline-first
astronaut health monitoring prototype

7
00:00:30,173 --> 00:00:34,856
developed by NYXARA NOVA for the
NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026.

8
00:00:35,776 --> 00:00:39,652
The Mission Dashboard brings health
records, recent measurements,

9
00:00:39,672 --> 00:00:42,709
alerts, and trends into one clear operational view.

10
00:00:43,629 --> 00:00:47,494
Crew members can record physiological
and behavioral indicators,

11
00:00:47,514 --> 00:00:51,804
explore related body systems, and
review their personal health history.

12
00:00:52,724 --> 00:00:57,785
Its transparent, rule-based engine
identifies unusual changes and explains why

13
00:00:57,805 --> 00:01:03,060
an alert appears, what it means, and when
medical attention should be considered.

14
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:09,404
ASTRA VITAL connects health indicators
with NASA's five human spaceflight hazards:

15
00:01:09,424 --> 00:01:15,378
space radiation, isolation, distance from
Earth, gravity fields, and hostile environments.

16
00:01:16,298 --> 00:01:20,082
Designed for intermittent
connectivity, it stores records locally

17
00:01:20,102 --> 00:01:23,768
and queues synchronization when
a connection becomes available.

18
00:01:24,688 --> 00:01:30,619
The prototype also explores real laboratory
datasets from NASA's Inspiration4 research,

19
00:01:30,639 --> 00:01:35,338
while keeping demonstration vital
signs clearly labeled as synthetic.

20
00:01:36,258 --> 00:01:37,100
ASTRA VITAL.

21
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:41,341
Clearer health insights for
human exploration beyond Earth.

22
00:01:41,361 --> 00:01:42,203
NYXARA NOVA.

23
00:01:42,223 --> 00:01:43,785
We control the unseen.
